Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼承包商给我12道开胃菜的清单  我得减到6道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So the wedding caterer sent me this list of 12 appetizers. I have to narrow down it to six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,食物问题  交给我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Food? Oh, give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡跟你们提过我们结婚时  要请《摇摆国王》来演唱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did Monica tell you about this great band called the Swing Kings that we're trying to get to play at the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候喜欢上摇摆音乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since when are you into swing music?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久以前就喜欢了  我曾跑遍全城听乐团演奏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh since forever. I used to go all over town listening to bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  在GAP的广告里看到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Gap commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你预订了吗  打电话了吗  我会打的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you book them? Did you call? I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我打吗  我会打的  你只需要做好你的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want me to call? No. I'll do it. You just stick to your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的工作是什么  别碍事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is your job? Staying out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能再减了  摩尼卡  你为什么不15样全选了呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is impossible Monica, Why don't you just pick all 15?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有12道而已  没错  我加了三道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There were only 12. Oh, yeah, I added three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是花生酱手指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are "peanut-butter fingers"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第17集  廉价婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E17  The One With The Cheap Wedding Dress
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是不是该上去和她聊聊啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Should we go try to talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  订婚的一大好处就是跟美女说话  不会感到紧张了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. That's one of the great thing about being engaged, I'm not nervous to talk to pretty girls anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能过来帮帮我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could you guys help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来帮你搬那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, let me get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它真的很重  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's really heavy. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是罗斯  他是我朋友钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So hi, I'm Ross, and this is my friend, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是克丽丝汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克丽丝汀  嗨  你刚搬来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kristen. Hi. Are you new to the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你刚搬来这里  我可以带你四处参观一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if you are, I'd love to show you around sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我从四条街外搬来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I actually just moved from four blocks over. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这里好像另外一个世界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But this block is like a whole other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上这个地区的历史非常有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know actually , it does have a very interesting history.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这条街是纽约第一条有下水道系统的街道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This street is the first street in the city to have an underground sewer system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前污水跟废弃物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before that, sewage and waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会直接流到街上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...would just flow right down the street. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时深及脚踝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sometimes ankle-deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搬完家后你一定会饿  不如晚上我带你去吃饭怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna be starving after moving. What do you say I take you to dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意  真的太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like that. Yeah? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你把箱子搬上去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me take this up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先请  不  你先请\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After you. Oh, no. After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我疯了  还是真的很配我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I crazy, or does this totally go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你看起来好漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! You look so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  瑞秋  但看看摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Rachel. But look at Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它  没错  就是这件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is it. Yeah, this is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信我终于找到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来好漂亮  如果我认识你  我会哭的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you look so beautiful. If I knew you, I'd cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是摩妮卡盖勒  尽量哭吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Monica Geller. Ball like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是梅根巴利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Megan Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到婚纱了吗  没有  这些婚纱都很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you found your dress yet? Oh no, These dresses are all so amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:04:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我买不起  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but there is no way I couldn't afford one. No, I can't afford this either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只来这里找婚纱  然后我会到克莱门婚纱店买  同样的东西那里有打折\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I-I-I’m, I'm just to figure out the one I want, then I'll get it at Kleinman's, this discount place in Brooklyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后天  那里有个大甩卖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Day after tomorrow, they're having a huge sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的情报  你什么时候结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for the tip. Yeah! So-so when are you getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  我不是  我只是喜欢试穿婚纱  跟我一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh I'm not. I just like to try these on. I do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在开玩笑  我7月25号结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just kidding. I'm getting married July 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也只是在开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just kidding too. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我12月结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting married in December.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候结婚  五月十五日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when are you getting married? Oh May 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  很快  是的  你请谁拍照\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. It's getting close. Yeah! So who's your photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰佛瑞   我们见过他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jeffrey. We met with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿裸体婚纱照给你们看了吗  那个伴郎吗  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did he show you the photos of the nude wedding photos? The best man? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我差点取消了婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I almost called off my wedding. Heh, heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你请了哪个乐团  我未婚夫想请《摇摆国王》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, who's your band? My  fiancee wants The Swing Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真幸运  我未婚夫想请《尸体》  那重金属乐团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're so lucky. My fiancee wants the heavy metal band, Carcass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是"湿"体还是"尸"体  那不重要  他们都很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that spelled with a "C" or a "K"? Oh, my God, it doesn't matter, they're both great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  你知道吗  别在这里买婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you know what? you know what? Don't buy that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你知道你喜欢哪一件  到克莱门婚纱店买  才半价\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now that you know what you want you should go to Kleinman's and get it half off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的婚纱太贵了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This place is so over-priced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是这里的老板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I own this store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件婚纱有别的颜色吗  还是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So does this come in another color, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你要搬进来还是搬走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. You moving in or moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要搬进来  需要我帮忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Moving in. Can I give you a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但是你得小心一点  来帮我的那个人因为背痛先走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but be careful. The guy who was helping before had to leave because he hurt his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你男朋友  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boyfriend? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是克丽丝汀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字真好听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. What a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你叫什么来着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克丽丝汀  对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kristen. Ah, that's it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你住在附近  是啊  我就住在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So uh, do you live around here? Yeah. Yeah, right down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得提供你一些资讯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me give you a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别在那个楼梯上睡觉   醒来时你的鞋子可能已经被偷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't take a nap on this stoop. You could wake up without shoes gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会记住的  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll remember that. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  今晚你要跟我一起吃饭吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, would you uh, would you like to have dinner with me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我有约了  明天可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have plans tonight. Oh. But how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错  这个要搬到哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds great. Well, where does this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很壮  把它交给我  你去帮我搬箱子吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look strong. I'll take that, you grab one of the boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（书  枕头）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我还是搬这个吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'll get this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（克莱门婚纱店五折大减价）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是布鲁克林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this is Brooklyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  听着  通常每件婚纱  一个尺寸只有一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, listen up. There's usually only one dress in each size.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一开门   我们马上冲进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when they open those doors, fan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们的目标  记住它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this is what you're looking for. Memorize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到婚纱后就吹哨子  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you locate the dress blow on these, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用力吹三声  一听到哨音后  马上跑过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three sharp blasts. When you hear it, come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, got it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在推我   别那么孩子气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, they're pushing! Don't be a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别档路  我们冲吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Out of the way! Let's go!
