Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它   就是这件  我的天啊  婚纱太完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is it! This is the dress! Oh, my God. It's perfect.
