Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  它就是  你看见我穿过得  现在你会看到我买下它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it is. You saw me wearing it. And now you'll see me buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你这个疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有我你根本不知道这个地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wouldn't even know about this place if it wasn't for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你不会想跟我争  也许我想呢  我很凶的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you don't want to fight me. Maybe I do. I'm pretty feisty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了  我来了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm coming! I'm coming! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该上哪边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  找到婚纱了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Did you find the dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到婚纱了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you find the dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  快把我弄出去  菲比  这些女人看见打折都疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. You gotta get me out of here Phoebe! These bargain shoppers are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去找摩妮卡  不  你得抓住我的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've gotta get Monica. No! You gotta hold my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  借过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  马上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey "Go! Now !!
