Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  前几天的约会怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Ross, how was your date the other night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和她谈起过那次冲洗厕所的奇妙之旅了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you tell her about the magical ride that starts with the flush of every toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管笑吧  但她给我留言  说她想再跟我约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Laugh all you want, but she left me a message saying she'd like to go out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我正要打电话给她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. In fact, I'll go call her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会告诉她   我的朋友钱德说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'll make sure and tell her my friend Chandler says...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  钱德  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉昨晚我失约了  我刚好有个约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, sorry I didn't stop by last night, but I had a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  那快凌晨一点  就算没过来也没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh Joe, when it's 1:00 in the morning and you don't come by? That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟一个辣妹约会  她刚刚搬到对面街\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well check it out. It was with this really hot girl who just moved in right across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  她就住在对面街  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Right across the street? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候认识她的   两天前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When did you meet her? Two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯也认识了个女孩  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Ross met somebody too. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我们星期六要再出去玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. We're going out again Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我刚刚发现她也在跟别人约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I just found out she's also seeing some other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  如果你是罗斯你会怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joe, what would you do if you were in Ross' situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他差不多  跟我约会的女孩也在跟别人约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I sort of am. I'm dating this girl who's also seeing another guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我一点都不担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm not too worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必担心  但相信我  我可不想当你的竞争者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well you shouldn't be. Believe me, I wouldn't want to be the guy who's up against you.
