Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我能留下来  相信我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish I didn't have to go. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不幸的是我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I unfortunately have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  顺便问下  跟你们约会的女孩叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh uh, By the way, what's the name of the girl you're dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克丽丝汀莱  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kristen Leigh. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  我们之中  只有一个人能继续跟她约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, obviously, only one of us can keep dating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我们该怎么决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Obviously. So how do we decide?
