Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我该跟她约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I should date her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我该跟她约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or I'm the one who dates her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太有趣了  但是听好了  我跟她约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's interesting. But check this out. I date her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但是换个角度来说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I like that. But just to go in another direction--
