Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我们该点些吃的  不  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah well we should order some food then. No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们为什么不让她来决定呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, why don't, why don't we just let her decide, okay?
