Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看她更喜欢谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we'll see who she likes best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sounds fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我会带她到新开的法国餐厅吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I'll take her to that new French restaurant down the street.
