Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没有钱带她去高级餐厅吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have the money to take her to a fancy place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只有抱歉了  但那是我的约会方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, sorry. That's what I do on dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我想我也有我的方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Well, I guess I'll just have to do what I do on dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来决定费用限制  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So let's decide on a spending limit. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加一片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And a slice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,六块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Six dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是一百块  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was thinking more like a hundred. Okay.
