Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你能帮我拿张面纸吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Can you hand me a tissue?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你家没有健怡可乐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're out of Diet Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You what?
