Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个梅根打来的  她订下《摇摆国王》  日期是我们结婚的那一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was that girl Megan. She booked The Swing Kings on the day of our wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还说如果我不把婚纱让给她  我就没有乐团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and said that I couldn't have them back unless I gave her the dress!
