Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办  那件婚纱  就是我一直想要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I gonna do? That's the dress! That is "the" dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德喜欢那个乐团  我该怎么办啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler wants the band. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想办法说服他放弃  那怎么做呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well just figure out a way to talk him out of it. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你家卫生纸用完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're out of toilet paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. What's up?
