Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你送克丽丝汀花  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you sent Kristen flowers? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你花了一百块  你把钱花光了  你完蛋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You spent 100 dollars. That's the limit. You're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在约会前送她花  所以技术上来说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I sent the flowers before the actual date, so technically...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技术上来说  我没有犯规  谢谢你来看我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...technically, I didn't break any rules. Thanks for stopping by though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要真的那么玩  我也可以犯规\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-oh! So that's the way it's gonna be? Yeah I can break the rules too. y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你打算怎么办  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah? What are you gonna do? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我一点都不讶异  告诉你罗斯  我不会放过你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why am I not surprised? Y'know what Ross? I'm not gonna let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你没有太多的选择  我们走着瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think you have much choice. Well we'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  对  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye-bye. Yeah, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  只要薄薄地敷一层就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! So just a light layer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道  只要敷这里跟这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, just here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊又把肉酱滴在栏杆上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey got meat sauce on the banister again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摇摆音乐太落伍了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, swing music is so out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  他要在这房间里才听得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, he's gotta be in the room for that to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在谈《摇摆国王》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well umm, we were just talking about the y'know, the Swing Kings ...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨论到底该不该请他们来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and just wondering whether y'know, they were the right way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次我去参加  请摇摆乐团来表演的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I went to a wedding once where they had swing music...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个月后他们就离婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and two months later the couple got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒不是说这其中必有联系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now I'm not saying there's any connection here y'know,...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们的确告诉我  那是他们离婚的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but they did tell me that's why they got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我喜欢摇摆音乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I love swing music!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但《摇摆国王》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah but The Swing Kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们烂到有人听他们的演唱会死掉  他们就那么死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know they suck so much that people actually die at their concerts. They just stop living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道摩妮卡跟我  去看他们演唱时非常开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look all I know is when Monica and I went to see them, we had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上还有一个原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there's another reason too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么原因  我不想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what is the other reason? I don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你非说不可  或许它很愚蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you have to, because maybe it's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡跟我  随着他们的音乐起舞时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well it's just while Monica and I were dancing to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我第一次知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it was the first time I knew that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是我想一辈子共舞的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you were the woman that I wanted to dance all my dances with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的桌子  马上就准备好  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So they said our table will be ready in just a few minutes. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的背好点了吗  没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is your back feeling better? Oh yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜肌肉越多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess, ahem, the more muscles you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就越可能抽筋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the more they can spasm out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克丽丝汀  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kristen? Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.03,0:16:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里做什么  我喜欢这个地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here? Oh I like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技术上来说  我没有犯规  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And technically, technically, I'm not breaking any rules, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  他是乔伊  乔伊  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Ross, this is Joey. Joey, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨  很高兴能认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi. It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.63,0:16:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前有个朋友叫乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used to have a friend named Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他现在不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的桌子马上就准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our table will be ready in a couple minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我想跟你们一起等  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure! I would love to wait with you guys! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你看起来好眼熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Joey, you look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上过电视或其它什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you on TV or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊不喜欢提这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well Joey doesn't like to talk about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他主演过《我们的日子》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but he's one of the stars of Days of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你不是演女人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. That's right. Don't you play a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是被困在男人身体里的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A woman in a man's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还好点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  罗斯  真有趣  因为我也觉得你很眼熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So y'know Ross it's funny, because you look familiar to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你结过婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you ever been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我结过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  前几天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, just the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克丽丝跟我还谈到  我结过婚  有个儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Kris and I talked about how I've been married and have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小艾力克  没错  等下  不  是小班才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, little Eric. That's right. Wait. No, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只结过一次婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you've just been married the one time then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你结过两次婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, um... You've been married twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后又结了一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...another time after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我饿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy, I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你曾经在约会时饿到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Hey, Joey, have you ever been so hungry on a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁女伴去上洗手问  偷吃掉她的食物吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that when the girl goes to the bathroom, you eat some of her food?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说服务生吃掉我的蟹饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said the waiter ate my crab cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你的第一段婚姻  为什么会结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. So, Ross, well now—why did that first marriage break up? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你前妻是异性恋  还是同性恋啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it because the woman was straight or because she was a lesbian?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个认识吗  不认识\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you two know each other? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是罗斯看起来像是  会跟有同性恋倾向的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. It just seems like Ross is the kind of a guy that would marry a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:19:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚后  逼得她非得出柜的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on the verge of being a lesbian and then push her over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你不是淋病海报上的那个男的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute! Were you on a poster for gonorrhea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟猴子同床共枕过吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you ever slept in the same bed with a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别把马塞尔扯进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you leave Marcel out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你曾经被自己的牛皮裤卡住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine! You ever gotten stuck in a pair of your own leather pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  你曾经把自己锁在电视柜里吗  性病小子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey! Have you ever locked yourself in a TV cabinet, VD-boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猴子迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monkey-lover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她是什么时候离开的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When do you think we lost her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是淋病那一段吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Probably around "gonorrhea."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  我回来了  别进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, honey, I'm home! Don't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你的另一个男朋友在里面吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why, do you have another boyfriend in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们只会在他家鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. We only mess around at his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是我开的头  但我开始担心了  你能出来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know it's funny, I started it, but now it's scaring me, so could you come out here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我正在穿婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I'm wearing a wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你买到婚纱了  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got a wedding dress? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但我要把它退回去  那我为什么不能看呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but I'm not keeping it. Well then why can't I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜应该可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I guess you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我得把它退回去  所以你绝不能喜欢它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay but; I-I have to return it, so you can't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我发誓  我保证会讨厌它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I promise. I'll hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你看起来好可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. You look hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那是我见过的最丑的婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. That's like the most ugliest dress I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要把它退回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you have to return it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它真的不合适\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh because it doesn't really fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我订了《摇摆国王》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, by the way, I booked The Swing Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是太棒了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great. Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那件婚纱可怕极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that dress, I mean, it's like, ugh, terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真想把它从你身上扯下来  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It makes me want to rip it right off you. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不可以把它弄破\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay! But you can't rip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许弄破点也没关系  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe a little. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想看看婚礼上  演唱歌曲的清单吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys, you want to look at the song list for the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你会去一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you'd be gone all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  或许我应该  让你们这些小女生独处一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I’m sorry. I'm sorry. I should probably leave you girls alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管笑吧  但十分钟后  我们的皮肤会变得又白又嫩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Laugh all you want, but in 1O minutes we'll have younger-looking skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也该敷一下脸的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, she could use a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好球  太帅了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, nice shot! Yeah! Oh! Oh! Oh!
